## Commands

```bash
# Backend (Flask/Python)
cd backend && flask run                  # Dev server (port 5000)
cd backend && pytest                     # Run tests
cd backend && pytest tests/unit          # Unit tests only
cd backend && alembic upgrade head       # Run migrations
cd backend && alembic revision --autogenerate -m "desc"  # New migration

# Frontend (Next.js)
cd frontend && npm run dev               # Dev server (port 3000)
cd frontend && npm run build             # Production build
cd frontend && npm run lint              # ESLint + Prettier
cd frontend && npm test                  # Jest/Vitest tests

# Infrastructure
# [CUSTOMIZE] terraform, docker-compose, deploy commands
```

## Architecture

- **Backend**: Flask (Python 3.11+), SQLAlchemy ORM, Alembic migrations
- **Frontend**: Next.js (TypeScript), Tailwind CSS
- **Database**: [CUSTOMIZE] PostgreSQL / Cloud SQL
- **Infra**: [CUSTOMIZE] GCP Cloud Run / AWS / Docker Compose
- **API**: REST with JSON, backend serves at /api/*

