## Conventions

- Backend: snake_case everywhere, type hints on all functions
- Frontend: camelCase for variables, PascalCase for components
- API responses: `{ "data": ..., "error": ..., "meta": ... }`
- Validate all inputs: Pydantic/Marshmallow on backend, Zod on frontend
- Never use `print()` — use the logger module
- Never use `console.log` — use the logger utility

## Important

- [CUSTOMIZE] Backend tests hit a real local DB — run migrations first
- [CUSTOMIZE] Environment variables in .env (never commit)
- Strict TypeScript: no `any`, no unused imports
- Python: type hints required, no bare `except:`

